From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:37:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 271/350] Assembly: the part files of the folder in the panel
 that puts parts

The panel that puts parts lists, below the open files, the FreeCAD, STEP
and IGES files of the assembly's folder (of the last folder used while the
assembly is not saved yet); a click opens one and lists its parts. The
step band no longer fails on an edited object without a document object
(an active assembly).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
